    <description><![CDATA[
# AdapterGit (Full Edition)

Pure-Rust Git implementation with zero external Git dependencies.
Never hangs, AI-safe, supports structured output.

**Full edition** includes:
- TLS/HTTPS transport
- AI-powered commit message generation
- Full network support (clone, push, pull, fetch)

## Features
- 29+ Git commands implemented natively in Rust
- Zero TUI blocking — safe for AI agents
- Structured JSON/YAML output
- Dual edition: full (installer) and lite (portable single binary)
    ]]></description>
